      "def_name": "VWE_Gun_SwarmMissileLauncher",
      "path": "VWE_Gun_SwarmMissileLauncher.description",
      "english": "A rocket launcher that fires eight small-bore explosive missiles that track different targets.\\n\\nBeing an extremely heavy weapon, this gun requires a power armor to be effectively used.\\n\\nThis weapon has limited number of uses.",
